# DVC-tracked datasets

This directory is managed by DVC. Do not commit large files directly.

## Structure

```
data/datasets/
  abaqus/       — Abaqus .odb/.inp exports (HDF5)
  moldex3d/     — Moldex3D flow simulation results
  aniform/      — AniForm draping outputs
  digimat/      — Digimat micromechanics results
  simutence/    — Simutence multi-process outputs
  cadfil/       — cadfil filament winding data
  experimental/ — Scarce real-world test data (ground truth)
```

## Usage

```bash
# Pull latest datasets
dvc pull

# Pull a specific subdirectory
dvc pull data/datasets/abaqus

# Push new data
dvc add data/datasets/abaqus/new_batch/
dvc push
git add data/datasets/abaqus/new_batch.dvc .gitignore
git commit -m "data: add new Abaqus batch"
```

## Remote

- Local dev: MinIO at http://localhost:9000 (bucket: dvc-store)
- Production: MinIO at $MINIO_ENDPOINT_URL (bucket: dvc-store-prod)
